<title>USA: AT&amp;T Universal Card names Srednicki CEO.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T Universal Card names Srednicki CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>AT&amp;T Corp said on Monday it named Rich Srednicki president and chief executive officer of AT&amp;T Universal Card Services, effective Jan. 20, 1997.</p>
<p>Srednicki most recently was general manager and country corporate officer of Citicorp's German consumer banking affiliate.</p>
<p>The company said Srednicki will report to John Walter, AT&amp;T's president and chief operating officer. Srednicki succeeds David Hunt, who resigned in September.</p>
